{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t昂船洲一艘泊岸船隻發生火警，消防接報到場，其後將火救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發於今早近10時，消防一度協助15人疏散。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T06:18:58.337831+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":58,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T05:59:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T16:30:47.034399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:17:37.002383+00:00","content_hash":"473b67bea256e5ae7b383b7a6103772ab53432190c78b6a6ef6a38454956736d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}